   In [src/index.js](file:///home/user/lineguard/src/index.js#L16-L21), the PR inserts the `pattern` check before `minLength`, `maxLength`, and `enum`, and **returns early** when the regex matches:
   ```js
   if (rule.pattern !== undefined) {
